---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="회사소개"
  description="고객 중심의 최대 이익을 목표로 하는 ㈜혁본의 인사말, 경영이념, 조직구성, 수행역량을 소개합니다."
>
  <article
    class="w-full px-4 md:px-0 pt-20 pb-40 max-w-[384px] md:w-[712px] lg:w-[948px] xl:w-[1316px] md:max-w-none mx-auto text-26 md:text-30"
  >
    <h1 class="text-28 md:text-40">회사소개</h1>
    <div class="pt-4 text-16 break-normal">
      <p>고객 중심의 최대 이익이라는 목표와</p>
      <p>상품의 가치 실현에 무한한 책임감과 희로애락을 느끼는 기업입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="pt-20 md:pt-32">
      <ul
        class="grid divide-y divide-sandline text-28 md:grid-cols-4 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0 md:text-22 lg:text-28"
      >
        <li class="py-4 md:py-0 md:pr-5">
          <a class="group" href="/about/greetings">
            <h3 class="main-color-transition group-hover:text-main">GREETING</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">인사말</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 md:py-0 md:px-5">
          <a class="group" href="/about/hierarchy">
            <h3 class="main-color-transition group-hover:text-main">HIERARCHY</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">조직도</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="py-4 md:py-0 md:px-5">
          <a class="group" href="/about/philosophy">
            <h3 class="main-color-transition group-hover:text-main">PHILOSOPHY</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">경영이념</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="pt-4 md:py-0 md:pl-5">
          <a class="group" href="/about/capability">
            <h3 class="main-color-transition group-hover:text-main">CAPABILITY</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">사업역량</p>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:mt-40 md:grid-cols-2">
      <figure class="hidden md:block">
        <img
          src="/혁본사무실.png"
          alt="혁본 사무실"
          class="h-full max-h-[420px] w-full border border-sandline object-cover"
        />
        <figcaption class="text-12 mt-2 font-medium tracking-widest text-olive">
          동탄 본사
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div>
        <p class="text-14 font-bold tracking-[0.25em] text-main">HISTORY</p>
        <p class="text-22 md:text-28 mt-2 font-extrabold tracking-tight">회사 연혁</p>
        <ul class="text-14 md:text-16 mt-6 font-light">
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-sandline py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2023. 07</p>
            <p>본사 이전 (경기도 화성시 동탄기흥로 614)</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-sandline py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2019. 11</p>
            <p>주택건설사업자등록</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-sandline py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2019. 10</p>
            <p>납입 자본금 3억원 증자</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-sandline py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2019. 09</p>
            <p>한국부동산마케팅협회 회원사 등록</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-sandline py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2018. 03</p>
            <p>1군 브랜드 시공사 협력업체 등록</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex border-l-2 border-main py-2.5 pl-5">
            <p class="w-20 shrink-0 font-bold text-main">2015. 06</p>
            <p>부동산 마케팅업을 목적으로 ㈜혁본 창립</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
